      "created_at": "2021-03-05T10:50:26Z",
      "updated_at": "2021-03-05T10:50:26Z",
      "body": "Hi @thomasmasereel - this cookie is used to know if the user's consent choices have changed since the last page load. It is a hashed (`cyrb53Hash`) value of the consent string with a 30 day expiration. The use case is as follows:\r\n- user visits the site and allows all vendors when first prompted.\r\n- user then changes their consent preferences\r\n- user visits another page on the site. at this point, it is important to refresh the user id's in case the relevant consent for those vendors have changed and they can issue a new ID (if applicable) or return a \"no-consent\" signal so that the ID is no longer available.",
      "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
      "pin": null,
      "reactions": {
