      "body": "@patmmccann atleast in germany the legal situation is that every cookie needs consent (regardless of the value or purpose).\r\nNot because of GDPR but because of an EuGH judgement (case C-673/17 - Planet49)\r\n\r\nI get that it's not reasonable to make it the default behavior but shouldn't it atleast be configurable?",
