      "body": "on Issue 1: https://github.com/prebid/Prebid.js/pull/6551/files#r1085664042 . It could be updated to skip writing the cookie, but:\r\n\r\non Issue 2: pubCommonId together with several other instances where core writes to storage are not affected by gdpr enforcement unless [`strictStorageEnforcement` is set](https://docs.prebid.org/dev-docs/modules/gdprEnforcement.html). This was discussed in https://github.com/prebid/Prebid.js/issues/8651 ",
